                    Louis St. Laurent.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d11-f7" n="42" xml:id="d11-f7-content">
                <p>The Canadian letter under reference here was circulated to the Deputies as
                    document CFM(D) (47) (G) 41, January 30, 1947,
                    not printed. Summaries of the views of the Canadian Government on the principal
                    aspects of the German problem were included in the Report by the Deputies for
                    Germany, February 25, 1947, <ref target="#pg40">p. 40</ref>.</p>
            </note>
